Walked into San Sabino at 5:30 on a weeknight and successfully got bar seats! Definitely one of the best Italian spots in the city. Started with the tricolor salad & cheesy frittelle. Was obsessed with the pepperoni carbonara which was one of the best pastas I’ve had in nyc. I will be dreaming of this meal

